  <History Date="17-12-07" Author="Ion Balan" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="13-03-08" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Updated" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="12-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Red1,Green1,Blue1 and replaced first cell in multi-cell modes.  Added v-dim to 3 DMX." />
  <History Date="12-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Simplified shutter.  Added palettes.  Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="15-10-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Added 60 and 63 channel mode." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="18-12-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Split into v1 version for Capture and added 4 DMX mode." />
  <History Date="19-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed 15 and 60 channel modes.  Added product thumbnail." />
